# =============================================================================
# DEPLOYMENT CONFIGURATION GUIDE
# =============================================================================

# 1. Choose your deployment scenario from above
# 2. Copy the relevant backend configuration to backend/config.env
# 3. Copy the relevant frontend configuration to .env
# 4. Restart your backend and frontend servers
# 5. Test the deployment configuration using the Global Deployment Management UI

# Available Jurisdictions:
# - US-Federal: United States Federal compliance (SOX, FedRAMP, HIPAA, CCPA)
# - EU-GDPR: European Union GDPR compliance
# - AP-Singapore: Singapore PDPA compliance
# - CA-Federal: Canada PIPEDA compliance
# - AU-Federal: Australia Privacy Principles compliance

# Available Regions:
# - us-east-1: US East (N. Virginia)
# - us-west-2: US West (Oregon)
# - eu-west-1: Europe (Ireland)
# - eu-north-1: Europe (Stockholm)
# - ap-southeast-1: Asia Pacific (Singapore)
# - ca-central-1: Canada (Central)
# - ap-southeast-2: Asia Pacific (Sydney)

# Data Residency Requirements:
# - US: Data must be stored in United States
# - EU: Data must be stored in European Union
# - Singapore: Data must be stored in Singapore
# - Canada: Data must be stored in Canada
# - Australia: Data must be stored in Australia 